    "Owner": "NLM",
    "CoiStatement": "Matthias G. Friedrich, Dominik Guensch and Kady Fischer hold a pending U.S. patent regarding the use of breathing maneuvers for diagnostics purpose (\u201cInducing and measuring myocardial oxygenation changes as a marker for heart disease\u201d, Serial No. PCT/CA2013/050608). Matthias G. Friedrich is also a board member, advisor and shareholder of Circle Cardiovascular Imaging Inc., the manufacturer of the software used for CMR image evaluation. There are no other conflicts of interest. This does not alter our adherence to PLOS ONE policies on sharing data and materials.",
    "Article": {
      "Pagination": {"MedlinePgn": "e0164524"},
      "PublicationTypeList": {"PublicationType": {
